      "content": "The walls are breached, and the fires are already reaching the inner sanctum. There's no way out, is there? My sword is notched, my men are gone, and the enemy is just... they're just waiting for me to crawl out. I've failed everyone. There is no glory left in this, just the shame of being captured and paraded around like a dog.",
